		"--nonPersistent",
		"-n",
		"--flag",
		"-f",
		":4",
		"Completion ended with directive: ShellCompDirectiveNoFileComp", ""}, "\n")

	if output != expected {
		t.Errorf("expected: %q, got: %q", expected, output)
